From the root of a checkout with bulk/wikipedia.py: PYTHONPATH=. python gen_wikipedia.py <three Wikinews NDJSON lines> (in the shared notes folder). input/articles.ndjson: synthetic edge cases, three real enwikinews-20261101 articles and fillers, run with --workers 1 so the second 32-job window starts with a deletion, an older copy and an empty body; frames.json: page_html with the body's inner HTML replaced by \x00INNER\x00; python/ and stdout.txt: python -m bulk wikipedia; hidden-stdout.txt: python -m bulk hidden-categories input/ns14.ndjson.
